          "title": "SPIRIT 2025 Checklist for the CoDiet WP5 Study Protocol",
          "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23674437",
          "publication_date": "2026-10-26",
          "description": "<p>This record contains the completed SPIRIT 2025 (Standard Protocol Items: Recommendations for Interventional Trials) checklist accompanying the study protocol entitled \"Use of an AI-driven personalised dietary advice or a general dietary advice to improve dietary intake in a population at risk of cardiovascular disease\".</p>\n<p>The CoDiet Work Package 5 (WP5) study is a multicentre randomised controlled trial designed to evaluate the effectiveness of AI-driven personalised dietary advice compared with general dietary advice in improving dietary quality and cardiometabolic health among adults at increased cardiometabolic risk.</p>\n<p>The checklist identifies the relevant sections of the study protocol corresponding to the SPIRIT reporting recommendations and is provided to support transparent and comprehensive reporting of the trial methodology.</p>\n<p><strong>Clinical trial registration:</strong> ISRCTN10538845.</p>",
          "access_right": "open",
          "creators": [
